    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jacob's Quest Anniversary Edition has Full Controller Support.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/extras/bf0da72ee8cafb5f1800c279ac2eb338.avif?t=1745521853\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Jacob's Quest 10th Anniversary Edition is now here for all owners of the game as a free upgrade, now magically remade from the ground up for modern PCs and displays. presented with awesome effects and upscaled sprites and post-processing effects galore. With revamped content, full controller support and so much more. Join us an celebrate the ten years it took to create Jacob's Quest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a Legend in Jacob's Quest Anniversary Edition, a JRPG that anyone can pick up and play. Save the four crystals of the world and prevent a vile plot from unfolding. With epic battles and world progression, Jacob's Quest is the RPG of choice, in development since 2014, and now magically remade from the ground up!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge elemental world to explore, with dungeons, puzzles and bosses to fight </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn sprites and excellent post-processing effects to modernise it's presentation </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A addictive soundtrack that immerses you in Jacob's World, featuring electric guitar segways </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional JRPG gameplay with action elements- jump, hookshot and block puzzles are a plenty. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Official Soundtrack jukebox to play the game's music whenever you like!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TURN BASED BATTLES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In classic 90's fashion, battle your way through challenging battles and bosses with turn based gameplay with a huge spell and abilities roster </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPELLING GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is JRPG at it's finest, with memorable characters, allies and bosses, 90's JRPG lovers must have this game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STEAM DECK COMPATIBILITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jacob's Quest Anniversary Edition is verified to be compatible with Proton through our internal testing.</strong> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981700/extras/bf0da72ee8cafb5f1800c279ac2eb338.avif?t=1745521853\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Jacob's Quest 10th Anniversary Edition is now here for all owners of the game as a free upgrade, now magically remade from the ground up for modern PCs and displays. presented with awesome effects and upscaled sprites and post-processing effects galore. With revamped content, full controller support and so much more. Join us an celebrate the ten years it took to create Jacob's Quest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a Legend in Jacob's Quest Anniversary Edition, a JRPG that anyone can pick up and play. Save the four crystals of the world and prevent a vile plot from unfolding. With epic battles and world progression, Jacob's Quest is the RPG of choice, in development since 2014, and now magically remade from the ground up!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge elemental world to explore, with dungeons, puzzles and bosses to fight </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn sprites and excellent post-processing effects to modernise it's presentation </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A addictive soundtrack that immerses you in Jacob's World, featuring electric guitar segways </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional JRPG gameplay with action elements- jump, hookshot and block puzzles are a plenty. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Official Soundtrack jukebox to play the game's music whenever you like!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TURN BASED BATTLES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In classic 90's fashion, battle your way through challenging battles and bosses with turn based gameplay with a huge spell and abilities roster </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPELLING GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is JRPG at it's finest, with memorable characters, allies and bosses, 90's JRPG lovers must have this game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STEAM DECK COMPATIBILITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jacob's Quest Anniversary Edition is verified to be compatible with Proton through our internal testing.</strong> </p>",
